stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending_validation: import / contribute
  pending_validation --> validated: accepted or edited by domain reviewer
  pending_validation --> rejected: rejected with reason
  validated --> pending_validation: content rejection by majority
  pending_validation --> deactivated: discard
  validated --> deactivated: discard-pair
  rejected --> deactivated: discard
  deactivated --> [*]
